<title>BELGIUM: Belgian money mkt supply raised in week.</title>
<headline>Belgian money mkt supply raised in week.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian National Bank said it added liquidity to the money market in the week to November 8 to offset a rise in notesin circulation (figures from the weekly statement in bln francs). -</p>
<p> Foreign currency reserves	   413.795( + 0.066)</p>
<p> Advances against pledged security  13.354( + 1.073)</p>
<p> Commercial bills			  3.252( + 0.076)</p>
<p> Securities portfolio		   23.820( + 0.497)</p>
<p> Money market interventions*	 107.696( + 0.303)</p>
<p> Bank notes in circulation	   450.262( + 2.204)</p>
<p>* comprises repurchase agreements and interbank loans</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
